  "prompt": "Mirror POV documentary shot. Gritty realistic concept art photograph. Weathered French peasant women, late 19th century, harvesting a vast wheat field. Calloused hands, coarse worn white linen shirts, heavy wool red dresses, red hair scarves, leather aprons. Operating a heavily weathered diesel powered walker mech rigged with farming plows, mud splattered everywhere. Far distance: immense industrial smoking steam war machines and brutalist angular military structures with cannons and guns, partially obscured by mist and smoke. Overcast natural light, analog film look, medium format and 35mm motion picture film. Style of Zhang Jingna. Film stills from \"Theory & Elysium.\" Environmental wide angle, eye level framing, dramatic chiaroscuro, deep focus, sharp lens, high contrast, fall shadows, wet muddy ground, highly detailed rust and mud textures, cinematic realism, cinematic depth. --chaos 4 --ar 2:3 --raw --profile 19gqozl --hd --preview --v 8.1",
